{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land turned to ash, every bullet counts. <strong>The Last Zone: Demo</strong> lets you sample fast-paced third-person combat fused with strategic base defense. Choose your weapons, lay traps, reinforce barricades, and plan against relentless, varied enemy waves. The wave system applies different pressure each run; you\u2019ll answer with a new solution every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo</strong>, you\u2019ll get a taste of the core loop: resource management, trap/barricade placement, weapon swapping, and well-timed abilities. Progress and content are limited; some features may change or expand in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast firefights + smart defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving enemy waves and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable traps and barricades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenging and tactical decision-making</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full version coming soon</strong> with more weapons, traps, enemy types, and modes. <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to be notified at launch!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3988970?t=1756882649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988970/9ce24f2120e78a3c7db40709b4b2645fba543f72/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756882649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988970/601ba3840bf175914d72f5b5db8f0a7d69647004/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756882649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988970/601ba3840bf175914d72f5b5db8f0a7d69647004/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756882649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a land turned to ash, every bullet counts. <strong>The Last Zone: Demo</strong> lets you sample fast-paced third-person combat fused with strategic base defense. Choose your weapons, lay traps, reinforce barricades, and plan against relentless, varied enemy waves. The wave system applies different pressure each run; you\u2019ll answer with a new solution every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In this demo</strong>, you\u2019ll get a taste of the core loop: resource management, trap/barricade placement, weapon swapping, and well-timed abilities. Progress and content are limited; some features may change or expand in the full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Demo Highlights</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast firefights + smart defense</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evolving enemy waves and behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgradable traps and barricades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenging and tactical decision-making</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full version coming soon</strong> with more weapons, traps, enemy types, and modes. <strong>Add to your wishlist</strong> to be notified at launch!</p>","developers":["Kodobur Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3988540","name":"The Last Zone"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3988970/4a0243ac0aee03cd1bbb2695e1493ba07c870380/header.jpg?t=1756882649","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\">